                        "sense_id": "ce937b31-774c-38bb-8edb-8fd1e7184cb2",
                        "entry_id": "8a3458d5-94d5-33ae-bdc9-613b5e02f1e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having been preceded by an announcement; declared."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33f821ca-a377-4956-863c-98e125b1be54",
                                "sense_id": "ce937b31-774c-38bb-8edb-8fd1e7184cb2",
                                "text": "But this test's very announced purpose was to measure and evaluate seismic signals at effective distances extending from the point of testing out to all distances where the signal could be detected."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff17f0a1-4730-4d26-a7fc-84c9791899ab",
                                "sense_id": "ce937b31-774c-38bb-8edb-8fd1e7184cb2",
                                "text": "Rational-expectations believers presumably must fall back on unannounced and inappropriate policies (monetary or other) , having declared that announced policies will be discounted ex ante."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "566e4e30-7e98-4999-99ed-da295a2afde6",
                                "sense_id": "ce937b31-774c-38bb-8edb-8fd1e7184cb2",
                                "text": "Boccherini's textural, lineless music offers many such passages that invite the listener to suppose something \"barely announced.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcc509d2-2dd6-41f0-b0ca-852d011f18f4",
                                "sense_id": "ce937b31-774c-38bb-8edb-8fd1e7184cb2",
                                "text": "The RCN calls for the CQC to undertake more announced and unannounced inspections, and for staffing metrics to be explicitly included within their approach."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
